{"about_the_game":"<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/e358a313ad827fc994daac4df310de49.webp?t=1749444495\" width=600 height=35 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Next-Gen of VR Sword-Fighting</h2><br>Battle Talent is a <strong>challenging physics-based roguelite sword-fighting </strong>game, you can create your own fighting style and experience unparalleled gameplay in a mega seamless procedural dungeon. With over 80 enemy variants, 100 weapons, and 60 perks, the possibilities are endless.<br><br>Join forces with your friends to take down enemies! Experience rich <strong>multiplayer</strong> interactions and create powerful combos!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/53ced430fa817b3f7b7440cebd77a84a.poster.avif?t=1749444495\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/53ced430fa817b3f7b7440cebd77a84a.webm?t=1749444495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/53ced430fa817b3f7b7440cebd77a84a.mp4?t=1749444495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Engage in realistic combat in <strong>Mixed Reality Mode</strong> (supports multiplayer) <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/3470112c5211fe232a941c8c9e10b6cd.poster.avif?t=1749444495\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/3470112c5211fe232a941c8c9e10b6cd.webm?t=1749444495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/3470112c5211fe232a941c8c9e10b6cd.mp4?t=1749444495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Experience thrilling physical combat with <strong>spell, melee, and ranged attacks</strong>. Beware, target the boss!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/870898407c1746007842a7429119c2e3.poster.avif?t=1749444495\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/870898407c1746007842a7429119c2e3.webm?t=1749444495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/870898407c1746007842a7429119c2e3.mp4?t=1749444495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Customize your talent points in <strong>Roguelike levels </strong>and unlock unexpected treasure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/75488a7a358d0b915b06385cdfee4fa3.poster.avif?t=1749444495\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/75488a7a358d0b915b06385cdfee4fa3.webm?t=1749444495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/75488a7a358d0b915b06385cdfee4fa3.mp4?t=1749444495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore <strong>Sandbox Mode</strong> to experiment with <strong>2000+ mods</strong> and Scene Editor feature.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/dc82e205c1b1f1ddaae3aa415ffaf458.poster.avif?t=1749444495\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/dc82e205c1b1f1ddaae3aa415ffaf458.webm?t=1749444495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/dc82e205c1b1f1ddaae3aa415ffaf458.mp4?t=1749444495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 game modes: Adventure, Challenge, Sandbox, Mixed Reality mode (Quest 3), Multiplayer Mode<br></li><li>Supports multiplayer mode for 2-4 players and includes a built-in voice chat<br></li><li>Built-in scripted mod menu with 2000+ mods, enhance your gaming experience<br></li><li>Thrill of hack-and-slash with realistic physics interactions.<br></li><li>Variety of enemies and bosses, over 80 enemy variants with different moveset<br></li><li>Plenty of weapons and perks, over 100 weapons and over 60 perks<br></li><li>Seamless huge dungeons with multiple landscapes that regenerate each time</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1331510?t=1749444495","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749444495","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749444495","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749444495","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"There is bleeding from broken limbs in the game, but it's optional, you could turn it off."},"de